      <title>谷歌给鼠标装上「大脑」，ChatGPT聊天框要凉？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/chatgpt-20260514181003606-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:10:03 +0800</pubDate>
